# Tuned settings for the ablit weights. scripts/serve.sh applies this file when WEIGHTS=ablit
# (--weights ablit); config/serve.env holds every setting the two weight variants share.
# Generated by the release tooling; do not edit by hand. A changed value is a configuration that was
# not measured, and scripts/status.sh --identity reports a changed file.
# SERVE_DRAFT_POLICY: with the DFlash2 draft model, how many drafted tokens the model checks per step:
# up to 7, as many as keep the estimated chance of acceptance (or the draft model's own confidence) at
# or above the given level, from 0.1 to 0.9.
# NO_DRAFTER_POLICY: without the draft model, the weights' own prediction head drafts up to 7 tokens,
# kept while its confidence is at or above the given level, from 0.1 to 0.9.
# Nothing else may be set here: every engine setting is in config/serve.env. Each value's comment says
# where it comes from.

# the release candidate's serving settings, developed and measured on the ablit data
SERVE_DRAFT_POLICY=fq7:0.3
# the release's setting for running without the draft model
NO_DRAFTER_POLICY=c7:0.3
